dies have shown we know the  whole  effects it has on us we can't continue  to go about thinking that there's no  effect and Rob bluntly asked you in  Washington you're not getting that great  of a reception are you from this current  administration well you know this has  been a process now that's been going on  for almost twenty years through multiple  administrations and you know we're  really hoping that people realize this  is not a political issue I mean it  shouldn't be a partisan issue I mean it  shouldn't be red or blue democrat or  republican we're talking about clean  water clean blood in a clean environment  something I would hope all of us support  but moving this through the regulatory  system and it's one of the things I try  to explore more detail in the book  exposure and you see that played out in  and ain't taking long the long process  in the movie dark waters as well this  takes a long time to move through this  regulatory system in the United States  and in the meantime at least we've got  states that are trying to move forward  and fill that gap and protect people in  the meantime you know I'm really hoping  that people see what but what people  like Bucky Bailey and mr. Tennant did  standing up one person you know can can  make a huge change by just standing up  and saying we're not gonna we're not  gonna put up with this and things need  to be different well you both have made  a huge change congratulations to you rob  the lot and Bucky Bailey thank you so  much for joining us tonight  and congratulations on the movie and  your new book exposure thank you very  much glad to be here

